  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Dr. Atul Mehta built a 37-year Cleveland Clinic career as a pulmonary clinician, teacher, and medical leader, helping train more than 200 international medical professionals and connect international patients with specialized care. His work included leadership in interventional pulmonology, lung transplantation, medical education, and Cleveland's Indian community."
